KONOHAGAKURE INTELLIGENCE DIVISION
CLASSIFICATION: EYES ONLY — HOKAGE AND DIVISION HEAD

Handling: This document is not to be copied, summarized in open
channels, or discussed outside a sealed briefing room. Improper
disclosure is a violation of the missing-nin protocol thresholds and
subject to disciplinary review.

Summary of Standing Concerns:
- The Akatsuki organization is confirmed to be systematically pursuing
  and extracting tailed beasts. Konoha's Nine-Tails jinchuriki is an
  identified target. Protective detail posture under review.
- Cross-referenced sensor and courier intelligence indicates a masked
  operative directing Akatsuki movements from concealment (see
  tobi_unknown_identity, bingo book).
- Sound Village (Otogakure) activity continues to warrant monitoring
  despite the founder's reduced visibility.

Action: Maintain the current watch posture. Escalate any confirmed
jinchuriki approach directly to the Hokage without intermediary.

Countersigned: Intelligence Division Head.
